#: src/app/preferences.vala:125
msgid "Music and lyrics"
msgstr ""

#: src/app/preferences.vala:126
msgid ""
"The song playing comes from any player that speaks MPRIS: Spotify, your "
"browser, VLC and most others. Lyrics come from LRCLIB, an open database "
"written by its users. Col sends it only the title, the artist, the album and "
"the length of the track, and keeps the answer on this computer, so each song "
"is asked once."
msgstr ""

