#: src/app/preferences.vala:166
msgid "Coding agents"
msgstr ""

#: src/app/preferences.vala:167
msgid ""
"Sessions in the island, and permission requests with Allow and Deny. Col "
"never signs in to any AI service: it only hears the hooks each agent calls "
"on this computer. Connecting adds Col's hooks to the agent's settings and "
"keeps a backup beside them."
msgstr ""

