msgid "Col for Linux"
msgstr ""

#: src/app/preferences.vala:254
msgid ""
"A preview: the island, the music playing with its lyrics, your coding "
"agents, the volume, the battery and a few tools. Col is free and open "
"source, under the MIT license."
msgstr ""

#: src/app/preferences.vala:256
msgid "About Col"
msgstr ""

#: src/app/preferences.vala:262
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr ""

#: src/app/preferences.vala:263
msgid ""
"No account, no telemetry. Col reaches the network only for LRCLIB while "
"lyrics are on, and for a cover when the player gives its address. Scripts "
"and agents reach Col through a socket only your account can open."
msgstr ""

